: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -24.1pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">신청대상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">창의적 아이디어 또는 기술을 보유 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">예비</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">창업자 및 벤처기업</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -30.2pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">예비창업자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">팀</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">), </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">개인사업자의 경우 업력</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나이 제한이 없으나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">법인사업자는 사업자등록일 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">년 이내</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">접수일 기준</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -31.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.6pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">경북 지역에 본사 또는 주된 사무소</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">공장포함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">를 두고 있거나 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">선정 후 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">년</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이내 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">경북지역에서 본사 또는 주된 사무소</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">공장포함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">를 이전할 계획이 있는 신청자</span></p><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p><!--StartFragment--><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; mso-tab