; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">C-Fund </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">투자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -30.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">삼성과 경상북도가 공동으로 조성한 펀드</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -30.2pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">투자의 전제 조건은 법인 설립 후</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">지분 투자의 형태로 진행</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -30.2pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">평가에 따라 기업별 차등 지급</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">최대 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING